            <h1>NZ Teen Issues</h1>
            <h4>Screen dependency causes major digital wellbeing challenges for young kiwis, including severe sleep disruption from late night scrolling and blue light exposure. This lack of rest worsens daytime anxiety, depression, and vulnerability to cyberbullying. </h4>
        </div>
        <div>
            <img class="small" src="static/nzteenissues.jpeg" alt="Teen on phone at night">
            <h4>The most serious issue is how this habits fracture our local communities and families. Almost half (49%) of NZ teens admit social media disrupts daily activities like homework, chores, and family time. While online spaces can offer a positive sense of belonging for some, replacing real world interactions.</h4>
